{"ID":"20240506112402-qdrrofg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506112402-qdrrofg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506112402-qdrrofg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506112402-o788acv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614115437-jmq4b1d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614115617-gk3bmm7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"373补16甘李根白皮（李根白皮、李根皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828142704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704160126-2aujfim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704160126-2aujfim","updated":"20240828142530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 424px;","style":"width: 414px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李根白皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李根白皮-20240704160126-xff6z2d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 414px;\" parent-style=\"width: 424px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828142619-gfxmm92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828142619-gfxmm92","updated":"20240828142619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 851px;","style":"width: 841px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树花8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树花8-20240704162419-i44qfp1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 841px;\" parent-style=\"width: 851px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 431px;","style":"width: 421px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704161942-kc5ww2x.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 421px;\" parent-style=\"width: 431px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828142544-saf3yq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828142544-saf3yq6","updated":"20240828142544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 569px;","style":"width: 559px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树花3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树花3-20240704161914-jl32col.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 559px;\" parent-style=\"width: 569px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 681px;","style":"width: 671px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树花1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树花1-20240704161812-se9o99g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 671px;\" parent-style=\"width: 681px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704160500-hy9mxmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704160500-hy9mxmh","updated":"20240828142702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李子-20240704160500-blgwqcu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李子3-20240704161659-gq151ux.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704162215-1988uh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704162215-1988uh7","updated":"20240828142704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树2-20240704161306-rc257z4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树4-20240704161416-a2rhu0u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704162630-fu5yxp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704162630-fu5yxp1","updated":"20240828142632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 895px;","style":"width: 885px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树10-20240704162630-k1gl8uf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 885px;\" parent-style=\"width: 895px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 305px;","style":"width: 295px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704162006-ngwdm89.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 295px;\" parent-style=\"width: 305px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704162141-2v0w0ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704162141-2v0w0ja","updated":"20240704162141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1201px;","style":"width: 1191px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"李树5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/李树5-20240704162141-f4b16lp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1191px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1201px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-rlyb18s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-rlyb18s","updated":"20240704160346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为李树的根皮，把外皮去掉，里面白色的部分跟木质层之间就叫李根白皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-jd3jxek","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-jd3jxek"}},{"ID":"20240614115617-gk3bmm7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115617-gk3bmm7","updated":"20240614115621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘李根白皮《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115617-naxk1jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115617-naxk1jj","updated":"20240614115617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《时习》云∶根皮大寒，主消渴，止心烦，气逆奔豚。仲景奔豚汤中用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115741-pp1c998","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115741-pp1c998"}},{"ID":"20240614115742-ygzaywy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115742-ygzaywy","updated":"20240614115752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘李根白皮《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115742-u59aal5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115742-u59aal5","updated":"20240614115742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"取东行者，去外皮，炙黄用。种类甚多。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115742-su4r3cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115742-su4r3cs","updated":"20240614115742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大寒，无毒。入足厥阴肝经。下肝气之奔冲，清风木之郁热。止消渴而除烦逆，断痢疾而收奔豚汤 甘草 半夏 生姜 生葛 川芎 当归 白芍 李根白皮 黄芩治奔豚上冲，胸腹痛，往来寒热。（诸方第一。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-akuuf2f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-akuuf2f"}},{"ID":"20240614115607-bv14ff7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115607-bv14ff7","updated":"20240614115612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘李根白皮《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115607-m1hbtll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115607-m1hbtll","updated":"20240614115607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】无。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115607-yggpzxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115607-yggpzxi","updated":"20240614115607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味涩，性寒，入足厥阴肝经。下肝气之奔冲，清风木之郁热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115607-tbhvope","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115607-tbhvope","updated":"20240614115607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"奔豚汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草二两，半夏四两，生姜四两，生葛五两，黄芩三两，芎?二两，当归二两，芍药二两，甘李根白皮一斤。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治奔豚气上冲胸腹痛，往来寒热。以阳亡脾败，陷遏乙木，木气郁发，冲于脐腹胸膈，则生疼痛，而兼寒热。缘乙木上冲，胃胆俱逆，少阳郁迫，内与阴争，胜负迭见，故寒热往来。厥阴风木之气，风动血耗，温郁为热。甘草补土缓中，生姜、?半夏，降甲戊之上逆，黄芩、生葛，清胆胃之郁热，芎、芍药，疏木而润风燥，甘李根白皮清肝而下冲气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115607-vqewalr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115607-vqewalr","updated":"20240614115607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘李根白皮甘寒敛涩，善下厥阴冲气，故治奔豚。其诸主治，止消渴，除烦逆，断痢疾，收带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-xjfqube","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-xjfqube"}},{"ID":"20240614115547-4zfwdlj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115547-4zfwdlj","updated":"20240614115551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李根白皮《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115547-cquqabu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115547-cquqabu","updated":"20240614115547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，大寒。止消渴心烦，解暴热丹毒，治奔豚气，疗赤白痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-lmpm968","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-lmpm968"}},{"ID":"20240614115537-fj2yyjv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115537-fj2yyjv","updated":"20240614115542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李根白皮《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115537-iriz883","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115537-iriz883","updated":"20240614115537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦微咸寒，无毒。炙黄用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115537-rwwrtoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115537-rwwrtoq","updated":"20240614115537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性论》云，入药用苦李根皮。而仲景治奔豚气，奔豚丸用甘李根白皮。时珍疑为二种，不知仲景言甘，是言李之甘，《药性》言苦是言根之苦。但宜用紫李根，则入厥阴血分。若黄李根则入阳明气分矣。《别录》治消渴奔豚，《大明》治赤白痢下，《千金》烧存性敷小儿丹毒，甄权治消渴香港脚，孟诜治妇人赤白带下，皆取苦咸降逆气也。李核仁苦平入肝，疗僵仆瘀血骨痛，又能清血海中风气，令人有子，故承泽丸用之。其性散结，故能解硫黄、白石英、附子毒。为末和鸡子白敷面 ，一宿即落，《千金方》也。《黄帝》云，李子不可和白蜜食，蚀人五内。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-fxpod9w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-fxpod9w"}},{"ID":"20240614115456-eezw8tf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-eezw8tf","updated":"20240614115500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李根白皮《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-ldsnv2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-ldsnv2k","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（别录上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-pwam7ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-pwam7ue","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】甘寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-dztylmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-dztylmm","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】消渴，止心烦，逆奔豚气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-l8d7gda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-l8d7gda","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶李，处处有之。树高丈许，绿叶白花，果极繁茂，与麦同候，麦秋至，李熟矣。种类近百，子大者如 如卵，小者如弹如樱。味有甘、酸、苦、涩之别；色有青、绿、紫、赤、黄赤、缥绮、胭脂、青皮、灰紫之殊；形有牛心、马肝、柰李、杏李、水李、离核、合核、无核、匾缝之异。生有武陵、房陵诸李。早则麦李、御李，四月熟。迟则晚李、冬李，十月、十一月熟。又有季春李，冬花春实也。王祯农书云∶北方一种御黄李，大如碗，肉浓核小，甘津香美；江南建宁一种均亭李，色紫肥大，香如兰蕙，味若醍醐；一种璧李，熟则拆裂糕液，如乳如酪，香甜可口；一种御李，花色红黄，实状樱桃，先诸李熟；一种夫人李，表绿里赤，肉好肥满，干之，嘉庆子也。素问云∶李韭皆酸。李，东方之果，木子也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-gfikvzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-gfikvzr","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"埤雅云∶李从木从子，性颇难老，老虽枝枯，子亦不细，品处桃上，果属有六，桃最为下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-utp8i0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-utp8i0i","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔子饭黍，不以雪桃。诗曰，投我以桃，报之以李。又曰，丘中有麻，彼留子嗟；丘中有麦，彼留子国；丘中有李，彼留之子。言麻以衣之，麦以食之。又有李焉，且皆丘中植之，则留子之政修矣。此人之所以思之，法言曰，男子亩，妇人桑之，谓思吕子产相郑，桃李之垂于街者，莫之援也。然则丘中有李，又能使人不盗也。尔雅曰∶桃曰胆之，枣李曰 之，盖枣李之脐，去 而已。旧云∶桃李种法，大率欲方，两步一株，密则阴辄相扇，不惟子细，味亦不隹也。谭子化书云∶李接桃而本强者，其实毛；梅接杏而本强者，其实甘。此明造化之权，有以知巧而移矣。本根皮白，甘酸二种，入药甘者良。修事，取东行者，刮去皱皮，灸黄用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115456-hi0ns3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115456-hi0ns3i","updated":"20240614115456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶李，木之多子，老至犹繁，累不易落。若荔实专力在系也，与麦同候，继绝续乏，承顺天施，养生之道也。仲景先生用治水逆犯上，病名奔豚，横滑难制者，用甘李根白皮，甘禀土味，秉制为用，转承水下，且木实得酸，根白金色，环承制化，在本则子令母实，在金则虚则补母，在土则承乃制之。溯流而上者，顺流而下矣。乃克治平，斯无不顺，何逆之有。子名嘉庆，良有以也。隐居别录广推奔豚者，肾之积，气从少腹上冲心，心烦逆，又若厥状，撞心消渴也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115421-3l97rdg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115421-3l97rdg"}},{"ID":"20240614115435-k6a6c6s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-k6a6c6s","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：李根皮"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-8931sdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-8931sdh","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-afn9sni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-afn9sni","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lǐ Gēn Pí"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-w00w0tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-w00w0tr","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-3b9a7gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-3b9a7gx","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘李根白皮（《金匮要略》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-hoazoxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-hoazoxf","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-9yys44m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-9yys44m","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-8c6mk1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-8c6mk1g","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-gvuixcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-gvuixcb","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蔷薇科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"李根皮的韧皮部"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-awxocyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-awxocyp","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-lz8m8i1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-lz8m8i1","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《长沙药解》：\"入足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-pcyhmz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-pcyhmz4","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-fvnl2aj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-fvnl2aj","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-s1wixaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-s1wixaf","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"大寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-lgdgzzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-lgdgzzg","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"味咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-x240mw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-x240mw2","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华于本草》：\"凉，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-qnjab6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-qnjab6u","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《滇南本草》：\"性寒，味苦涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-lp91uhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-lp91uhz","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-7tlrfxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-7tlrfxe","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，下气。治消渴心烦，奔豚气逆，带下，齿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-n9tw6r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-n9tw6r3","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《吴普本草》：\"治疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-jwb8cky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-jwb8cky","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主消渴，止心烦、逆奔气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-m8mis5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-m8mis5c","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③陶弘景：\"水煎含之，疗齿痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-cppqclm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-cppqclm","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"治脚下气，主热毒，烦躁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-ydmwmsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-ydmwmsp","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤孟诜：\"主女人卒赤白下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-726efhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-726efhs","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《长沙药解》：\"下肝气之奔冲，清风木之郁热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-1d05t1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-1d05t1k","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-72m82ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-72m82ku","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～3钱。外用：煎水含漱或磨汁涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-2nsebs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-2nsebs1","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-3rc06k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-3rc06k9","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治奔豚气上冲胸，腹痛，往来寒热：甘草、芎藭、当归各二两，半夏四两，黄芩二两，生葛五两，芍药二两，生姜四两，甘李根白皮一升。上九味，以水二斗，煮取五升，温服一升，日三，夜一服。（《金匮要略》奔豚汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-ij79lad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-ij79lad","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治咽喉卒塞：以皂角末吹鼻取嚏，仍以李树近根皮，磨水涂喉外。（《菽园杂记》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-y3nrev0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-y3nrev0","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-ogaqvdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-ogaqvdn","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-72wnujb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-72wnujb","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：李根皮"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-frqqfok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-frqqfok","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-q87aack","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-q87aack","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lǐ Gēn Pí"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-bv4vw87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-bv4vw87","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-wn9t54g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-wn9t54g","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘李根白皮、李根白皮"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-wa39wx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-wa39wx4","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-7zmvf4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-7zmvf4d","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Root-bark of Japanese Plum"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-br9pqbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-br9pqbx","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-gw4fyht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-gw4fyht","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-8iypro8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-8iypro8","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-y4137i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-y4137i8","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蔷薇科植物李的根皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-g6mpegb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-g6mpegb","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Prunus salicina Lindl."}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-ouohjkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-ouohjkk","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采挖。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-j3yeuxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-j3yeuxs","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-xozk31p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-xozk31p","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔400-2600m的山沟路旁或灌木林内。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-wp7ozx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-wp7ozx9","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：除内蒙古、新疆、西藏外，全国各地多有分布和栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-w8ehwzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-w8ehwzs","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-rvpf7x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-rvpf7x1","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 李 乔木，高达9-12m。树皮灰褐色，粗糙；小枝无毛，紫褐色，有光泽。叶柄近顶端有2-3腺体；叶片长方倒卵形或椭圆倒卵形，先端急尖或渐尖，基部楔形，边缘有细密浅圆钝重锯齿。花两性；通常3朵簇生；萼筒杯状，萼片及花瓣均为5；花瓣白色，雄蕊多数；排成不规则2轮；雄蕊1，柱头盘状，心皮1，与萼筒分离。核果球形或卵球形，直径3.5-5cm，栽培品种可达7cm，先端常稍急尖，基部凹陷，绿、黄或带紫红色，有光泽，被蜡粉：核卵圆形或长圆形，有细皱纹。花期4-5月。果期7-8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-zl5jtxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-zl5jtxb","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-pqzvht3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-pqzvht3","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根皮呈卷曲筒状，槽状或不规则块片状，长短宽窄不一，厚0.2-0.5cm。外表面灰褐色或黑褐色栓皮；内表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，有纵皱纹。体轻，质韧，纤维性强，难折断。气微，味苦而涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-x9pzr6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-x9pzr6k","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-y3zgmw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-y3zgmw1","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；脾；心经"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-axoeany","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-axoeany","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-komlpbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-komlpbq","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；咸；寒；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-btxkaje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-btxkaje","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-5onssiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-5onssiq","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 降逆，燥湿，清热解毒。主气逆奔豚，湿热痢疾，赤白带下，消渴，脚气，丹毒疮痈"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-mvy8fjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-mvy8fjo","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-e4rne67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-e4rne67","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-9g。外用：适量，煎汁含漱或磨汁涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-vjbwadn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-vjbwadn","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-wc3g2cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-wc3g2cu","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《吴普本草》：治疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-6ekjqj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-6ekjqj3","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《名医别录》：主消渴，止心烦、逆奔气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-vr22kx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-vr22kx5","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.陶弘景：水煎含之，疗齿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-bn47cav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-bn47cav","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药性论》：治脚下气，主热毒，烦躁。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-d6sfady","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-d6sfady","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.孟诜：主女人卒赤白下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-hdbch4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-hdbch4g","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《长沙药解》：下肝气之奔冲，清风木之郁热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-xzkzq7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-xzkzq7p","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草纲目》：李根白皮刮去皱皮，炙黄入药用。《别录》不言用何等李根，亦不言其味，但《药性论》云入药用苦李根皮，味咸，而张仲景治奔豚气奔豚汤中用甘李根白皮，则甘、苦二种皆可用欤？。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-oe4j1ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-oe4j1ed","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本经逢原》：《药性论》云入药用苦李根皮，而仲景治奔豚气责豚汤用甘李根白皮，时珍疑为二种，不知仲景言甘，是言李之甘，《药性》言苦，是言根之苦，但宜用紫李根皮则入厥阴血分，若黄李根则入阳明气分矣。《别录》治消渴奔豚，大明治赤白痢下，《千金》烧存性敷小儿丹毒，甄权治消渴脚气，孟诜治赤白带下，皆取苦咸降逆气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-19p6atf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-19p6atf","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614115435-uhv3qda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115435-uhv3qda","updated":"20240614115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614115436-u96bn65","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614115436-u96bn65"}},{"ID":"20240614115437-jmq4b1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614115437-jmq4b1d"}}]}